  "text": "[NRTM.5.1] RT execution has two phases: an **INIT** phase, in which schemas /\nrules load, the pools are sized, and the intern table is warmed, and a **LIVE**\nphase, in which the engine pumps under the bounded contract with no allocation\nand no structural change.\n\n",
